  "body": "A prized position with the beach within reach and Rangitoto framing your view.  Wake up to this beautifully presented apartment 802. With natural light, this immaculate two bedroom apartment offers a cleverly balanced floor plan, excellent built in storage and an effortless sense of comfort and style.  Every space has been thoughtfully utilised, creating a delightful easy care home that is equally appealing as a permanent residence of sophisticated lock and leave retreat in the heart of Takapuna.  \r\n\r\nThe Sentinel is renowned for its exceptional resort style facilities, including a heated swimming pool, gym, sauna, spa pool, bbq entertaining areas and friendly concierge. Adding to the appeal are two secure car parks, a storage locker and a separate storage shed, valuable extras that enhance the convenience of apartment living.  With Takapuna Beach, cafes, restaurants, shopping and coastal walks just moments away, this is a beachside lifestyle location that is hard to beat.  A rare opportunity to secure an immaculate apartment in one of the Sentinels most desirable positions, where views, sun, light and effortless living comes together.  \r\n\r\nPhone Alison Parker, Takapuna Specialist at New Zealand Sotheby's International Realty on 021983533 to view today.",
